window.EN={"1":"Having successfully rescued Cecilia and Princess Guinivere, Roy","2":"was guided by Sophia, who claimed to be a shrine maiden of the \"Village of Nabata,\"","3":"and headed for the Nabata Desert, in the center of the Mithel Peninsula.","4":"According to Sophia, the \"Village of Nabata\" lay in an oasis region within the desert,","5":"and was now under attack by the Bern army, she said.","6":"Bern's target may be the \"dragon\" that lives there...","7":"As they hurried toward the village, Roy and the others found a great wall in their path: a sandstorm.","8":"Come on! Hurry, Fae.","9":"If we get to the back of the temple, there'll be somewhere to hide.","10":"Can you run that far?","11":"Ehh... Fae's tired...","12":"Don't be difficult. Come on, before Bern's soldiers get here...","13":"What about big sister Sophia?","14":"I don't know. She may have been caught by the Bernese soldiers...","15":"Hey, if I get caught by Bern, will I get to go to the outside world?","16":"Absolutely not.","17":"Didn't the elder also say we mustn't mix with the outside?","18":"Bleh... booo-ring...","19":"...Still, how in the world","20":"did Bern find out about this \"Village of Nabata\"?","21":"A while ago, Sophia was saying something","22":"about an ominous \"power\" she felt from the Bern army...","23":"...I wonder if there's some connection to that...","24":"What's wrong? You're zoning out.","25":"Oh! This isn't the time to be thinking about that.","26":"Fae, this way, hurry!","27":"I wanna see... the outside world...","28":"Zeiss! Is General Narcian still not here?","29":"Yes sir. The mercenaries and the \"dragon\" have arrived as reinforcements,","30":"but General Narcian's unit still hasn't shown up.","31":"Damn it, what in the world is he doing!","32":"With just the forces we have now, occupying this entire village is impossible, and yet...","33":"......","34":"For now, I must at least","35":"report to His Majesty about the \"dragon\" said to be in this village...","36":"Zeiss, you head to Aquleia, the royal capital of Etruria.","37":"His Majesty should be passing through there right about now.","38":"What should I report?","39":"...There appears to be something like a \"dragon\" in this village as well.","40":"According to the one we captured, it's a \"dragon\" called the \"Divine Dragon.\"","41":"And a \"Divine Dragon,\" among dragons, is said to be the \"dragon\" with the greatest power... That's all.","42":"Yes sir. I'll go at once.","43":"Hurry.","44":"What a terrible sandstorm.","45":"Yes... This sandstorm","46":"has protected our village... from the outside... all this time...","47":"I see. With this, it doesn't seem like we'll be found.","48":"So, which way should we go?","49":"Yes... Straight ahead like this... to the northeast...","50":"Only...","51":"Only what?","52":"Because of the sandstorm... all sorts of things blown into the desert... may have fallen here...","53":"Please watch your step...","54":"Earlier, someone passed by heading into the depths of the desert, didn't they, Maggie?","55":"Yeah, they did, Rose.","56":"So it really is true that there's a hidden village deep in here, huh, Maggie.","57":"Yeah, that's right, Rose.","58":"But I really don't want to get lost in the sandstorm, you know, Maggie.","59":"If that happens, we won't be able to get back, huh.","60":"So, should we just give up on the hidden village after all, Maggie?","61":"But they say there's treasure in there like nothing we've ever seen, Rose.","62":"That, I definitely want to get my hands on.","63":"It'd make a lot more money than robbing desert travelers, wouldn't it, Rose.","64":"But I really don't want to get lost, Maggie.","65":"How about this: we follow behind the people who passed through here, Rose?","66":"That's a great idea.","67":"So, we just finish those people off later, right, Maggie?","68":"That's the idea.","69":"All right, let's go, Maggie.","70":"Yeah, let's go, Rose.","71":"The sandstorm has died down...","72":"This is our chance, Lord Roy. We can clearly see where the village is!","73":"But the same goes for the enemy. Let's hurry, in any case!","74":"Ah... something's... shining...","75":"Oh my... what a beautiful ring...","76":"Sometimes you find strange things buried in the desert.","77":"If you're really lucky, you might find something, you know.","78":"Why don't you try looking somewhere that seems suspicious?","79":"Do you know the story of Delphi, the \"Winged God\"?","80":"It's a god believed since ancient times to protect all who soar through the sky.","81":"They say that with its protection, there's no danger in flying through the sky on a pegasus or wyvern...","82":"...Huh? Guess that didn't work out, Rose?","83":"...Huh? That really hurt, Maggie.","84":"There's no blind spot in my blade. Light, or steel...","85":"Choose. Choose how you're going to die.","86":"Impressive...","87":"At the end... I got to fight a strong one like you...","88":"...If Sophia survives and the village is taken within 25 turns","89":"That was a tough opponent... but with that, we should be fine now.","90":"Sophia, where are the people of the village...","91":"What's wrong?","92":"Lord Roy... the entrance to the temple...","93":"This door... it's been forced open.","94":"I take it this leads to the temple deeper inside — is something enshrined there?","95":"...Something called a \"Divine Weapon\"... a tome is... inside...","96":"A \"Divine Weapon,\" you say!? There was one here in this village too?","97":"...The reason Bern attacked here...","98":"could it be that their goal was to steal a \"Divine Weapon\"!?","99":"If that's so... are we too late!?","100":"But... it's still... inside... the \"Divine Weapon\" is...","101":"What? How do you know?","102":"...Its \"power\"... I can still... feel... the \"power\" of the \"Divine Weapon\"...","103":"I see!","104":"If it's now, we might still be able to stop it from falling into Bern's hands!","105":"Let's hurry!","106":"...If Sophia has died or the village is taken from turn 26 onward","107":"Hm? And who might you be, young ones?","108":"How did you get in here!","109":"My name is Roy.","110":"I came here with Sophia to protect this village.","111":"With Sophia, you say...","112":"So that's how it was. So it was you all who drove off the Bernese soldiers.","113":"That was a rude thing of me to say. I am the elder of this \"Village of Nabata.\"","114":"Elder... then, could it be, perhaps, that you are the \"dragon\"?","115":"...A \"dragon,\" is it. There was a time I was called that, yes...","116":"But that's a story from long, long ago. Now I'm nothing more than an old fool.","117":"......","118":"That's right. The only one in this village who can purely be called a \"dragon\" now is this child, Fae.","119":"Ehehe...","120":"What! This girl is a \"dragon\"...","121":"Though she's still a long way from being fully grown.","122":"...Elder, you wouldn't happen to know anything about the \"dragon\" in Bern, would you?","123":"What did you say!? There's a \"dragon\" in Bern?","124":"Yes, we've already seen it ourselves, several times.","125":"Why would that be... \"Dragons\" shouldn't exist anywhere but in this village now...","126":"Elder, might I have a moment?","127":"What is it, Igrene?","128":"Some time ago, Sophia was speaking of an ominous \"power\" she sensed from Bern.","129":"...Might there be some connection to that?","130":"...Perhaps so.","131":"But... I no longer have the power left to sense such things.","132":"What do you mean by an ominous \"power\"?","133":"Perhaps because she carries half the blood of a \"dragon,\" Sophia has a strange power.","134":"However, she only senses something vaguely,","135":"and says she can only tell that what's in Bern is also a \"power\" that has been unnaturally distorted.","136":"I think it should be confirmed.","137":"Would it be all right if I accompanied them and looked into Bern myself?","138":"...It's not that I want anything to do with the outside, truth be told... but it can't be helped.","139":"Lord Roy, would that be all right?","140":"Yes, of course.","141":"I am Igrene, one who protects this village.","142":"I have confidence in my skill with a bow, so I believe I can be of help in battle as well.","143":"That's reassuring. I look forward to working with you.","144":"Fae wants to go too!","145":"What are you saying, you can't.","146":"If the outside world found out you existed, who knows what would happen!","147":"Mmm...","148":"Well then, shall we go?","149":"Yes.","150":"...Fine. I'll just follow along secretly."};
